{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing Things Up</strong> is an adult visual novel that blends romance, drama, and mystery in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of a young man who moves to South Lake to start college, full of expectations and ready for a new chapter. But things take an unexpected turn when you are mistakenly placed in a house with women who are intense, intriguing, and driven by their own desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you get involved, the more layers begin to unravel, and the more dormant truths within yourself start to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll discover not only love and desire, but also scars from the past, silent manipulations, unhealed wounds, and intentions that are not always what they seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a journey of self-discovery, pleasure, and growing risks, where every connection brings you closer to, or further from, who you truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dive deeper?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910610?t=1757972004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910610/326f1e848d04df7c5d20fb3caf97c84eb801029a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757972004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910610/cf6c4733f040ea3b082778278233ed1f80fc654e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757972004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910610/cf6c4733f040ea3b082778278233ed1f80fc654e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757972004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id